+
+**The bot also resumes on a written answer.** While a plan is open, the entrance reads *«ok»* or *«no»* against it and the bot resumes through the same `Negotiation.answer` a tap does. A plan has two buttons, *Va bene* and *Non mi va*; a shorter one is asked for in words.
